  "api": "new JDWX\\DNSQuery\\Packet\\ResponsePacket(string $i_data, int $i_size)",
  "scope": "One RFC 1035 DNS message from local bytes through the ResponsePacket constructor only; no Resolver, transport or socket is created. Header keeps the reserved Z bit, AD and CD; the harness assembles z from them. Types and classes are decoded to mnemonics and mapped back to numbers through the library's Lookups tables. AAAA::rrSet prints eight uncompressed hex groups; the harness compresses that text (inet_pton/inet_ntop) to RFC 5952 form. Names get a trailing dot and lower case."
